# Studio 64: the Shoggoth pieces made from the game's data at build time (tools/shoggoth/rom_parts.py:
# the dressed Toads' vanilla triangles, the recoloured Toad caps and Goomba faces). Everything else of
# the Shoggoth content (src/studio/shoggoth/gen, shotgun, vehicles, katana, sound/sound_banks/26_studio_tokyo.json,
# the hack's own synthesised custom_sh_*.aiff samples) is the user's own and ships.
src/studio/romgen/
